The historical human and mouse annotation tables under src/mRNA/_data were
preserved from atopos 1.0.0, commit bc81127, copyright BioQuest / ScienceAdvances.
The original atopos source backup and Apache license are located in the sibling
atopos repository. No third-party statistical backend source is vendored.

The archived filenames identify h38_gene_info_v43 and m39_gene_info_v32. Their
original gene-length derivation and full annotation provenance were undocumented.
They are exposed explicitly as legacy references, not current or certified
effective-length annotations. Users may supply their own versioned references.

Analysis dependencies retain their own licenses. Cite the original limma,
DESeq2, edgeR, GSEA/GSEApy and regulator-activity methods as applicable, together
with the selected Python implementations and versions.
